      "body": "## What problem does this solve or what need does it fill?\n\nTo use `bevy_mat`, users need to add it explicitly via `bevy_math = \"...\"` in `Cargo.toml`.\n\n## What solution would you like?\n\nI think it would be nice for `bevy_math` to be re-exported from `bevy`, like it's done for other crates, together with its `prelude`.",
